        "Handler drops the Request suffix and appends Handler"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Routing the generator uses",
      "items": [
        "The first [CrudUpdate] takes the plain {id} PUT",
        "Every later update and every action takes {id}/{segment}",
        "Default segment is the method name kebab-cased"
      ]
